---
layout: page-shell.njk
title: Apply - Penta Housing Co-Op
permalink: /apply.html
---
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 md:py-16">
  <header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 md:mb-14">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight text-gray-900 mb-5">Apply for Membership</h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Join our cooperative housing community in Vancouver. We're a member-owned housing cooperative that provides affordable, sustainable housing while fostering community connections. Our residents participate in governance and share in maintaining our beautiful property together.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10">
    {% if site.applicationsOpen %}
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 md:mb-12">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-5"><svg class="h-12 w-12 text-green-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-green-600 mb-3">Applications Are Open!</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">We're currently accepting applications for available units.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section aria-labelledby="available-unit-heading" class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7">
        <h3 id="available-unit-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-5">Current Available Unit</h3>
        <dl class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-5">
          <div><dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800">Unit type</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base text-gray-800">{{ site.unitListing.type }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800">Monthly housing charge</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base text-gray-800">{{ site.unitListing.monthlyHousingCharge }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800">Move-in date</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base text-gray-800">{{ site.unitListing.moveInDate }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800">Application deadline</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base text-gray-800">{{ site.unitListing.applicationDeadline }}</dd></div>
          <div class="md:col-span-2"><dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-800">Household requirements</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-800">{{ site.unitListing.householdRequirements }}</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center py-1">
        <a href="{{ site.applicationFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-open-application data-analytics-skip-external class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white text-base sm:text-lg px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 font-medium shadow-sm transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-green-600 focus:ring-offset-2"><svg class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h6"/></svg>Complete Application Form</a>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3">Opens in a new tab</p>
      </div>

      <section aria-labelledby="unit-alternatives-heading" class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7">
        <h3 id="unit-alternatives-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Don't Qualify for This Unit?</h3>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Sign up to receive one email from Penta when a home matching your preferences becomes available. You can withdraw anytime. See our <a href="/privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        {% include "email-signup.njk" %}
      </section>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 md:mb-12">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-5"><svg class="h-12 w-12 text-orange-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-orange-600 mb-3">Applications Currently Closed</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">We don't currently have any available units. Applications typically open every 2 or 3 years.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section aria-labelledby="get-notified-heading" class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7">
        <h3 id="get-notified-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Get Notified</h3>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Sign up to receive one email from Penta when applications open for a home matching your preferences. You can withdraw anytime. See our <a href="/privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-green-700 underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        {% include "email-signup.njk" %}
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="application-process-heading" class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-7">
        <h3 id="application-process-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Application Process</h3>
        <ol class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
          <li class="text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mx-auto mb-3">1</div><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Get Notified</h4><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Request one email when a matching home becomes available.</p></li>
          <li class="text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mx-auto mb-3">2</div><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Apply</h4><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Submit your application when a suitable unit opens up.</p></li>
          <li class="text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mx-auto mb-3">3</div><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Interview</h4><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">If selected, participate in our community interview process.</p></li>
          <li class="text-center"><div class="w-11 h-11 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mx-auto mb-3">4</div><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Move In</h4><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Welcome home! Join our thriving cooperative community.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </section>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</div>
